    "q-54165": {
      "dom_id": "step-q54165",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "Find a value of $x$ satisfying the equation $\\operatorname{cot}⁡{61}^{∘}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡x.$",
      "worked_solution": "Since the cotangent of an angle equals the tangent of its complement, we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cot}⁡{61}^{∘}=\\operatorname{tan}⁡({90}^{∘}-{61}^{∘})=\\operatorname{tan}⁡{29}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $x={29}^{∘}$ satisfies the given equation.",
