    "q-76838": {
      "dom_id": "step-q76838",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "$\\operatorname{cot}⁡({27}^{∘}-\\theta )=$",
      "worked_solution": "We know that the cofunction of $\\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta $ is $\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta ,$ and the angle complementary to ${27}^{∘}-\\theta $ is \n\n$$\n{90}^{∘}-({27}^{∘}-\\theta )={90}^{∘}-{27}^{∘}+\\theta ={63}^{∘}+\\theta .\n$$\n\nSo we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cot}⁡({27}^{∘}-\\theta )=\\operatorname{tan}⁡({90}^{∘}-({27}^{∘}-\\theta ))=\\operatorname{tan}⁡({63}^{∘}+\\theta ).\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-76838-a",
